<%- include('_partials/head') %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>

<main class="container page-container">
    <section class="page-header-center">
        <span class="badge-pill">Advertise</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">Discuss a disclosed placement or partnership</h1>
        <p class="page-desc">Kurukoo has a bounded reviewed placement catalogue for eligible public content and carefully separated workspace sponsorship. A proposal is not an approved campaign, provider verification, reach guarantee, billing arrangement, or fulfilment claim.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="placements-card">
        <h2 class="section-h2">Placement options</h2>
        <div class="placements-grid">
            <div class="placement-box">
                <h3 class="placement-box-title">Public content sponsorship</h3>
                <p class="placement-box-desc">A clearly labelled native or inline placement may be considered on eligible homepage, Explore, Topic, Resource, Discover-feed, or provider-related content surfaces. It is always separate from organic providers and Radar map data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="placement-box">
                <h3 class="placement-box-title">Workspace sponsorship</h3>
                <p class="placement-box-desc">An approved campaign can appear only in the dedicated Daily Picks sponsor panel, never as a personal suggestion or private chat message. Frequency, category, market, budget, and safety rules still apply.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="placement-box">
                <h3 class="placement-box-title">Category and affiliate context</h3>
                <p class="placement-box-desc">Eligible campaigns can be assigned to approved contextual slots. Evidence-backed affiliate offers may appear only where the relevant affiliate boundary permits them. Neither is a stock, price, availability, provider, or delivery confirmation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="advertise-cta-box">
        <h2 class="section-h2">Ready to advertise?</h2>
        <p class="advertise-desc">Self-service advertiser onboarding, billing, third-party programmatic inventory, conversion guarantees, and paid reach guarantees are not available in this deployment. Use Web Chat to describe a proposal; an operator can review approved placement, disclosure, evidence, and commercial-collection boundaries.</p>
        <a href="/chat?prompt=I%20want%20to%20discuss%20advertising%20or%20a%20partnership" class="btn advertise-cta-btn">Discuss in Web Chat</a>
    </div>
</main>

<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
